  <article class="atlas-thesis">
    <p class="atlas-kicker">RESEARCH ECONOMIST · EVIDENCE SYSTEMS</p>
    <h1 id="atlas-title">
      I turn uncertain data<br />
      into decisions people can<br />
      <em>inspect and defend.</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="atlas-thesis__lead">
      Research design, econometrics, geospatial intelligence, interactive data products, and quantitative training from the estimand to the interface.
    </p>
    <div class="atlas-thesis__actions">
      <a class="atlas-primary-action" href="/start?source=counterfactual-atlas">Bring me the decision <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a class="atlas-secondary-action" href="/work">Explore selected work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </article>

  <div class="atlas-synthetic-label">
    <strong>SYNTHETIC DEMONSTRATION</strong>
    <span>SEED 1931 · NO CLIENT DATA</span>
  </div>

  <div class="atlas-stage-rail" role="group" aria-label="Analytical stage">
    <button type="button" data-stage-button="observe" aria-pressed="true">
      <span>01</span><strong>Observe</strong><small>Raw field</small>
